; Example ledger for the Year in Review and Cash Flow screenshots (see
; screenshots.py): five years of a household's pay, home and mortgage, savings,
; investments and spending. It also shows two accounts declared out of income and
; expenses: retirement-plan gains, realized by a 2024 rollover that sells a fund in
; the old plan and buys it again in the new one (investing), and a loan-repayment
; account that a mortgage payment passes through across a year end (financing, from
; its name).
option "title" "Household"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2019-12-01 custom "fava-extension" "beancount_sg.ext.year_end"
2019-12-01 custom "fava-extension" "beancount_sg.ext.cash_flow"

2019-12-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2019-12-01 open Income:Salary USD
2019-12-01 open Assets:Home USD
  investable: FALSE
2019-12-01 open Assets:Bank:Savings USD
2019-12-01 open Assets:Brokerage
  cash-flow-role: "investing"
2019-12-01 open Assets:Retirement:OldPlan
2019-12-01 open Assets:Retirement:NewPlan
2019-12-01 open Income:Retirement:Gains USD
  cash-flow-role: "investing"
2019-12-01 open Expenses:LoanRepayment USD
2019-12-01 open Liabilities:Home:Mortgage USD
2019-12-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard USD
2019-12-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries USD
2019-12-01 open Expenses:Food:Restaurants USD
2019-12-01 open Expenses:Home:MortgageInterest USD
2019-12-01 open Expenses:Home:Utilities USD
2019-12-01 open Expenses:Insurance USD
2019-12-01 open Expenses:Shopping USD
2019-12-01 open Expenses:Travel USD

